---
import Base from "@layouts/Base.astro";
import DemoNav from "@components/DemoNav.astro";
import "@styles/demo.css";
---

<Base
	title="loom demo"
	description="Host a multiplayer tabletop game run by cooperating AI agents on loom, a Go multi-agent runtime, with per-turn costs. Or rewire an agent pipeline."
>
	<div class="demo">
		<DemoNav slug="loom" position="top" />
		<section class="wrap demo-intro" data-cloud="network">
			<p class="eyebrow"><b>loom</b> · Go · live demo</p>
			<h1>Agents that work together, on a real runtime.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				<code>loom</code> is the orchestration layer I built under an AI storytelling product: versioned agents,
				multi-agent turns, hooks, session forks, budgets and a cost ledger. Host a <b>multiplayer tabletop game</b>:
				write the world, share a code, and let an AI game master run it, or run it yourself with AI-voiced NPCs.
				Every round shows what each agent cost. Or rewire an <b>agent pipeline</b> and watch loom schedule it.
			</p>
			<div id="api-status"></div>
		</section>

		<section class="wrap demo-body">
			<div class="panel">
				<div class="panel-hd">
					<span class="label">Model &amp; key</span>
					<span class="spacer"></span>
					<span class="chip" id="mode-chip">Dry run</span>
				</div>
				<div class="panel-bd key-grid">
					<label class="field"><span>Model</span><select class="select" id="model"></select></label>
					<label class="field"><span>API key</span><input class="input mono" id="key" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Leave empty for a dry run" /></label>
					<button class="btn" id="verify" type="button">Check key &amp; price</button>
					<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="remember" /> Keep for this tab</label>
					<div class="key-note stack">
						<div id="verify-result"></div>
						<p class="dim">
							When you host a game, your key stays in the demo server's memory for that game only, is never
							written to disk or logs, and pays for every AI step at your table. Players never need a key.
							Use a key with a low spend limit and revoke it afterwards. Each game is capped at 400 agent steps a day
							by loom's own budget guard. No key? Everything runs as a dry run with canned model output.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="tabs" role="tablist" style="margin-top:20px">
				<button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="tabletop">Multiplayer tabletop</button>
				<button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="pipeline">Agent pipeline</button>
			</div>

			<!-- ===================== Tabletop: lobby ===================== -->
			<div data-pane="tabletop" class="pane" data-cloud="die" data-cloud-size="0.5">
				<div id="lobby" class="grid-2">
					<form class="panel" id="create">
						<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Host a game</span></div>
						<div class="panel-bd stack">
							<label class="field"><span>Title</span><input class="input" id="g-title" maxlength="60" required placeholder="Bells Under Water" /></label>
							<div class="field"><span>Start from</span><div class="row" id="g-presets"></div></div>
							<label class="field"><span>The world</span><textarea class="textarea prose" id="g-world" rows="5" maxlength="1500" required placeholder="Where are we, what's wrong, who wants what?"></textarea></label>
							<div class="field"><span>NPCs (up to 4)</span><div class="stack" id="g-npcs"></div>
								<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="g-add-npc" style="align-self:flex-start">Add NPC</button></div>
							<fieldset class="field"><span>Who runs the game?</span>
								<div class="choices choices-2">
									<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="g-mode" value="ai" checked /><b>An AI game master</b><small>Five agents run every round. You play a character too.</small></label>
									<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="g-mode" value="human" /><b>I'll be the game master</b><small>You narrate. AI voices your NPCs and, if you like, keeps the books.</small></label>
								</div>
							</fieldset>
							<label class="check" id="g-bookkeeping-row" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="g-bookkeeping" checked /> AI bookkeeping: a referee updates sheets and a chronicler keeps the summary after each narration</label>
							<div class="stack" id="g-character">
								<label class="field"><span>Your character's name</span><input class="input" id="g-char-name" maxlength="20" placeholder="Nkem" /></label>
								<fieldset class="field"><span>Archetype</span><div class="choices" id="g-archetypes"></div></fieldset>
							</div>
							<div class="row"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="g-create">Create game</button><span class="dim" id="g-create-status" role="status"></span></div>
						</div>
					</form>

					<form class="panel" id="join">
						<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Join a game</span></div>
						<div class="panel-bd stack">
							<p class="mid">Got a code from a friend? You don't need an API key to join; the host's key runs the table.</p>
							<label class="field" style="max-width:200px"><span>Game code</span><input class="input mono" id="j-code" maxlength="6" placeholder="K7QF2M" style="text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.2em" /></label>
							<label class="field"><span>Your character's name</span><input class="input" id="j-name" maxlength="20" placeholder="Ada" /></label>
							<fieldset class="field"><span>Archetype</span><div class="choices" id="j-archetypes"></div></fieldset>
							<div class="row"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Join</button><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" id="j-watch">Just watch</button><span class="dim" id="j-status" role="status"></span></div>
						</div>
					</form>
				</div>

				<!-- ===================== Tabletop: room ===================== -->
				<div id="room" hidden class="stack">
					<div class="panel">
						<div class="panel-hd">
							<b id="r-title"></b>
							<span class="chip" id="r-mode"></span>
							<span class="chip" id="r-status"></span>
							<span class="chip" id="r-watching"></span>
							<span class="spacer"></span>
							<span class="code-big" id="r-code"></span>
							<button class="btn btn-sm" id="r-copy" type="button">Copy invite link</button>
							<button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="r-leave" type="button">Back to lobby</button>
						</div>
						<div class="panel-bd" id="r-world-wrap"><details><summary>The world</summary><p class="mid" id="r-world" style="margin-top:8px;white-space:pre-wrap"></p></details></div>
					</div>

					<div class="split-wide">
						<div class="stack">
							<div class="panel">
								<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">The story</span><span class="spacer"></span><span class="chip" id="r-round"></span><span id="r-busy" hidden class="row" style="gap:6px"><span class="pulse"></span><span class="dim mono" style="font-size:.7rem">agents working</span></span></div>
								<div class="panel-bd"><ol class="list-plain feed" id="feed"></ol></div>
								<form class="panel-bd composer" id="composer" hidden>
									<div class="row" id="suggestions"></div>
									<div class="composer-row">
										<label class="sr-only" for="action">Your action</label>
										<input class="input" id="action" maxlength="300" autocomplete="off" placeholder="What do you do?" />
										<button class="btn btn-primary" id="act" type="submit">Act</button>
									</div>
									<p class="dim" id="composer-note" style="font-size:.8rem;margin-top:8px"></p>
								</form>
								<div class="panel-bd" id="room-error"></div>
							</div>

							<div class="panel" id="host-panel" hidden>
								<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label" id="host-label">Host controls</span><span class="spacer"></span>
									<button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" id="h-start" type="button" hidden>Start the game</button>
									<button class="btn btn-sm" id="h-resolve" type="button" hidden>Resolve round now</button>
									<button class="btn btn-sm" id="h-key" type="button" hidden>Reconnect my key</button>
									<button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="h-end" type="button">End game</button>
								</div>
								<div class="panel-bd stack" id="dm-console" hidden>
									<label class="field"><span>Narrate</span><textarea class="textarea prose" id="dm-text" rows="4" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Resolve the players' actions and describe what happens."></textarea></label>
									<div class="row"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="dm-narrate" type="button">Narrate</button><span class="dim" style="font-size:.8rem" id="dm-narrate-note"></span></div>
									<div class="grid-2">
										<div class="stack">
											<p class="eyebrow">Call for a check</p>
											<div class="row">
												<select class="select" id="dm-check-player" style="flex:1 1 120px"></select>
												<select class="select" id="dm-check-ability" style="flex:0 0 80px"><option>STR</option><option selected>DEX</option><option>CON</option><option>INT</option><option>WIS</option><option>CHA</option></select>
												<input class="input" id="dm-check-dc" type="number" min="5" max="25" value="12" style="flex:0 0 70px" aria-label="Difficulty class" />
												<button class="btn btn-sm" id="dm-check" type="button">Roll</button>
											</div>
										</div>
										<div class="stack">
											<p class="eyebrow">Adjust a character</p>
											<div class="row">
												<select class="select" id="dm-adj-player" style="flex:1 1 120px"></select>
												<input class="input" id="dm-adj-hp" type="number" min="-8" max="8" value="0" style="flex:0 0 70px" aria-label="HP change" />
												<input class="input" id="dm-adj-item" maxlength="40" placeholder="item gained" style="flex:1 1 110px" />
												<button class="btn btn-sm" id="dm-adjust" type="button">Apply</button>
											</div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="panel-bd stack" id="npc-console" hidden>
									<p class="eyebrow">Make an NPC speak</p>
									<div class="row">
										<select class="select" id="npc-name" style="flex:0 1 180px"></select>
										<input class="input" id="npc-direction" maxlength="300" placeholder="Direction, e.g. refuses, but drops a hint" style="flex:1 1 200px" />
										<button class="btn btn-sm" id="npc-speak" type="button">Speak</button>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<aside class="stack">
							<div class="panel">
								<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">The party</span></div>
								<div class="panel-bd"><ol class="list-plain party" id="party"></ol></div>
							</div>
							<div class="panel">
								<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Cost</span><span class="spacer"></span><span class="chip" id="c-model"></span></div>
								<div class="panel-bd stack" id="cost"></div>
							</div>
							<div class="panel">
								<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">This round, step by step</span></div>
								<div class="panel-bd"><ol class="list-plain steps" id="live-steps"><li class="dim">Agent steps appear here as they finish.</li></ol></div>
							</div>
						</aside>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- ===================== Pipeline ===================== -->
			<div data-pane="pipeline" class="pane" hidden data-cloud="network" data-cloud-size="0.5">
				<div class="grid-2">
					<div class="panel">
						<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Agents</span><span class="spacer"></span>
							<button class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="pl-reset" type="button">Reset</button>
							<button class="btn btn-sm" id="pl-add" type="button">Add agent</button>
						</div>
						<div class="panel-bd stack">
							<p class="mid">You never declare dependencies. Each agent's template references other agents' outputs as <code>{"{{.Inputs.Name}}"}</code>; loom reads those references, checks every one has a producer, and plans the graph into layers that run concurrently. The first agent is the lead. Uses the model and key above.</p>
							<label class="field" style="max-width:200px"><span>Input name</span><input class="input mono" id="pl-input-name" /></label>
							<label class="field"><span>Input</span><textarea class="textarea" id="pl-input" rows="8"></textarea></label>
							<ol class="list-plain stack" id="pl-agents"></ol>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stack">
						<div class="panel">
							<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Plan</span><span class="spacer"></span>
								<button class="btn btn-sm" id="pl-plan" type="button">Check wiring</button>
								<button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" id="pl-run" type="button">Run</button>
							</div>
							<div class="panel-bd stack">
								<div id="pl-status"></div>
								<div class="layers" id="pl-layers"><p class="dim">Check the wiring to see how loom will schedule these agents.</p></div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="panel">
							<div class="panel-hd"><span class="label">Outputs</span><span class="spacer"></span><span class="chip" id="pl-cost"></span></div>
							<div class="panel-bd"><ol class="list-plain stack" id="pl-outputs"><li class="dim">Run the pipeline to see each agent's output, tokens and cost.</li></ol></div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<DemoNav slug="loom" position="bottom" />

		<section id="feedback"></section>
	</div>
</Base>

<script>
	import "../../scripts/demo/loom.js";
</script>
